  {"content":"Earlier in this conversation (context, not requests for you):\n\nUser:\nNote that the vault code is cobalt.\n\nEmber agent:\n\nTool call: route({\"kind\":\"chat\"})\n\nEmber tool (route):\n[tool:route]\nroute=chat\n\nEmber agent:\nReply 2.\n\nUser:\nAnd the door is teal.\n\nEmber agent:\n\nTool call: route({\"kind\":\"chat\"})\n\nEmber tool (route):\n[tool:route]\nroute=chat\n\nEmber agent:\nReply 4.\n\nUser:\nswitch to Scout\n\nScout agent:\nScout here.\n\nUser:\nWhat do you know so far?\n\nScout agent:\n\nTool call: route({\"kind\":\"chat\"})\n\nScout tool (route):\n[tool:route]\nroute=chat\n\nScout agent:\nReply 6.\n\nUser:\nAdd that the key is under the mat.\n\nScout agent:\n\nTool call: route({\"kind\":\"chat\"})\n\nScout tool (route):\n[tool:route]\nroute=chat\n\nScout agent:\nReply 8.\n\nUser:\nWhat was added?\n\nEmber agent:\n\nTool call: route({\"kind\":\"chat\"})\n\nEmber tool (route):\n[tool:route]\nroute=chat\n\nEmber agent:\nReply 10.\n\nUser:\nSummarize everything.\n\nEmber agent:\n\nTool call: route({\"kind\":\"chat\"})\n\nEmber tool (route):\n[tool:route]\nroute=chat\n\nEmber agent:\nReply 12.\n\nUser:\nOne more detail: the alarm code is 4512.\n\nEmber agent:\n\nTool call: route({\"kind\":\"chat\"})\n\nEmber tool (route):\n[tool:route]\nroute=chat\n\nEmber agent:\nReply 14.\n\nUser:\nswitch to Nova","role":"user"}
